   - get_call_stack → Returns {"success":true,"data":{"frames":[{"id":42,"name":"processUser","source":"/workspace/src/app.ts","line":45,"column":1},{"id":41,"name":"handleRequest","source":"/workspace/src/server.ts","line":18,"column":1}],"totalFrames":2,"truncated":false}}
