I need to inspect the function "parse" in /src/parser.ts.

STEP 0 - Read Debug Configuration (Full Automation Mode):
Before starting debugging, you need to find the correct configuration name:

a. List available resources:
   Call: list_resources()
   Example response: {"resources":[{"uri":"debugssy:///myproject/launch.json","name":"myproject Debug Configurations","description":"Debug configurations from myproject/.vscode/launch.json. Use the \\"name\\" field from configurations when calling start_debugging.","mimeType":"application/json"}]}

