   Example response: {"contents":[{"uri":"debugssy:///myproject/launch.json","mimeType":"application/json","text":"{\\n  \\"configurations\\": [\\n    { \\"name\\": \\"Launch Program\\" }\\n  ]\\n}"}]}

d. Parse the JSON response to find "configurations" array
   Each configuration has a "name" field (e.g., "Launch Program", "Debug Tests")

